.indiatimes.com/india/intention-is-to-ensure-ec-works-impartially-mallikarjun-kharge-moves-cec-removal-motion-in-mock-parliament-top-quotes/articleshow/135398586.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-10-31T16:24:52+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Rohitashwa Ranjan</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-135398620,imgsize-146186.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA['It's done bro': J&amp;K CM Omar Abdullah marries Nidhi Razdan; shares photos of 'new journey']]></title><description>&lt;a href="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/its-done-bro-jk-cm-omar-abdullah-nidhi-razdan-share-photo-of-their-new-journey/articleshow/135398123.cms"&gt;&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/135398123.cms" /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;<![CDATA[]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/its-done-bro-jk-cm-omar-abdullah-nidhi-razdan-share-photo-of-their-new-journey/articleshow/135398123.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/its-done-bro-jk-cm-omar-abdullah-nidhi-razdan-share-photo-of-their-new-journey/articleshow/135398123.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-10-31T16:14:34+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Rajeev Singh</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-135398377,imgsize-147198.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA['Already been uprooted': Akhilesh, Awadhesh target Amit Shah over 'Angad's foot' remark]]></title><description>&lt;a href="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/already-been-uprooted-akhilesh-awadhesh-target-amit-shah-over-angads-foot-remark/articleshow/135397358.cms"&gt;&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/135397358.cms" /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;<![CDATA[Akhilesh Yadav condemned Amit Shah's claims about 